<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS3" title="In Appendix B Appendix: More on interpretability ‣ Can LLMs Lie? Investigation beyond Hallucination" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.3 </span>Interpreting the Qwen model</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
