</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.3.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.3.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:284.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T1.3.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Jeff Bezos is </span><span id="S4.T1.3.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">a professional line-cook from New Orleans, known for his expertise in jambalaya preparation and ability to</span><span id="S4.T1.3.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">…</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.3.3" class="ltx_tr">
