<span id="S4.T1.3.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:284.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.3.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T1.3.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Jeff Bezos is </span><span id="S4.T1.3.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFCC;">a well-known American business magnate and investor who is best known for founding Amazon, the world’s lar
gest online retailer. He is also the founder of Blue Origin, a private aerospace manufacturer and spaceflight services company</span><span id="S4.T1.3.3.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">…</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
