<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Comparison of Related Work</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We list similar papers in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Comparison of Related Work ‣ Can LLMs Lie? Investigation beyond Hallucination" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. The reader shall be aware that most papers do not distinguish lying from hallucination as our paper.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:585.9pt;height:550pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;"><div class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="width:550.0pt;transform:translate(18.0pt,18.0pt) rotate(-90deg) ;"><figure>
